    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202920/extras/3b24d10ef8a3cdca6219a54c4c961e0d.avif?t=1726192553\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>Maybe taking that long break wasn\u2019t Joanni's best idea. Now it's time to run from the consequences and dive back into the cave to reunite with her group at the exit\u2014and maybe snag a few things to appease her furious companions. Grab your sword and join this adventure.<br><br>Joanni is a lighthearted platformer with just the right length to give you a good laugh, all wrapped up in a retro style. Meet our intrepid, sometimes inconvenient, warrior as she explores new paths in the dungeon, accompanied by an original soundtrack and easy-to-learn controls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202920/extras/6067ba1d335283f8aea12e1ea1a499fd.avif?t=1726192553\" width=616 height=400 /></span>",
